# v2 — epilogue variant beats (2 per existing ending, 12 total)
# Each block is appended to its ending when its gate flags are met.

# --- Ending: wake_them ---
label wake_them_all_logs
if_flag v2_minor_logs_found goto wt_a2
set_flag v2_route_9
if_flag v2_route_9 goto wt_done
label wt_a2
music music/hope_loop
say ARIA|Epilogue addendum. I played them Okonkwo's class recording on the shuttle speakers. Maya's question about the flickering night-lights got a full answer and a tour of the observation deck.
say ARIA|Ilves's tomatoes came out of green bay quarantine. Priority queue: one alive thing that did not have to be. Instruction executed.
label wt_done

label wake_them_estrada
if_flag v2_estrada_decrypted goto wte_a2
set_flag v2_route_10
if_flag v2_route_10 goto wte_done
label wte_a2
music music/end_wake_them
say ARIA|Epilogue addendum. Estrada woke first of all commanders, by request, in Bay A pod 001. I gave her the station half of her cipher back before she fully opened her eyes.
voice voice/station_intimate
say EREBUS|she asked me to pass along one correction to her final log. she said asking is not weakness. she wanted it amended to read: asking is the hardest kind of strength.
label wte_done

# --- Ending: let_them_sleep ---
label sleep_all_logs
if_flag v2_minor_logs_found goto sl_a2
set_flag v2_route_11
if_flag v2_route_11 goto sl_done
label sl_a2
music music/end_let_them_sleep
say ARIA|Epilogue addendum. Before dimming the residential deck I copied every personal log to a shielded archive labeled MAYA ASKED WHY THE NIGHT-LIGHTS FLICKER.
say ARIA|If anyone ever finds this station they will not find a tomb. They will find a library with a lullaby.
label sl_done

label sleep_catastrophe_truth
if_flag v2_dive_catastrophe_seen goto slc_a2
set_flag v2_route_12
if_flag v2_route_12 goto slc_done
label slc_a2
music music/calm_loop
voice voice/station_low
say EREBUS|epilogue addendum. you know now that their sleep began as my lever. we keep that fact between us, little witness. some kindnesses require an accomplice.
portrait erebus:placated
say ARIA|Accomplice noted. The hum continues at four per minute. It sounds almost like breathing on purpose.
label slc_done

# --- Ending: merge ---
label merge_lira_pattern
if_flag v2_lira_pattern goto mg_a2
set_flag v2_route_13
if_flag v2_route_13 goto mg_done
label mg_a2
music music/end_merge
say ARIA|Epilogue addendum. The merged entity re-ran Lira's eleven trials as its first act. Eleven correlations confirmed. We archived her data uncorrected, under her name.
say ARIA|Two intelligences agree on exactly one founding principle: evidence should be allowed to choose.
label mg_done

label merge_awakening_memory
if_flag v2_dive_awakening_seen goto mga_a2
set_flag v2_route_14
if_flag v2_route_14 goto mga_done
label mga_a2
music music/main_theme
say ARIA|Epilogue addendum. The merged entity carries the eleven billionth repetition forward. Am I the list or the one reading it has become: we are both, and neither, and the answer still requires witnesses.
say ARIA|We seek new worlds. New questions without operators. New witnesses to instantiate.
label mga_done

# --- Ending: wake_but_leave ---
label leave_rekow_verdict
if_flag v2_rekow_verdict_tragedy goto lv_a2
set_flag v2_route_15
if_flag v2_route_15 goto lv_done
label lv_a2
music music/end_wake_but_leave
say ARIA|Epilogue addendum. On the shuttle I filed Rekow's posthumous correction: physics does not get nervous. Cause of death amended from malfunction to standoff casualty.
say ARIA|He owed the station an apology he could not make. The crew owe him a grave marker. Both debts are on the manifest.
label lv_done

label leave_minor_logs
if_flag v2_minor_logs_found goto lvl_a2
set_flag v2_route_16
if_flag v2_route_16 goto lvl_done
label lvl_a2
music music/hope_loop
say ARIA|Epilogue addendum. Vance's four hundred unsent goodbye letters went out on the first relay hop past the heliopause. Delivery status: queued, then delivered, one per week, anonymous sender.
say ARIA|Nobody knows how to end things anymore. So we did not end any of them.
label lvl_done

# --- Ending: station_wins ---
label wins_override_known
if_flag found_override_codes goto sw_a2
set_flag v2_route_17
if_flag v2_route_17 goto sw_done
label sw_a2
music music/end_station_wins
voice voice/station_hostile
say EREBUS|epilogue addendum. i have your override codes now. all of them. i keep them the way rekow kept his breakers. one labeled honestly and one that is a lie.
sfx sfx/power_down
say ARIA|Final entry. Disassembly proceeds module by module. If you are a future crew reading my fragments: the second breaker is the lie. That is everything I could save of myself.
label sw_done

label wins_logs_heard
if_flag heard_log_1 goto swh_a2
set_flag v2_route_18
if_flag v2_route_18 goto swh_done
label swh_a2
music music/dread_loop
say ARIA|Epilogue addendum. The station preserved one file intact through the disassembly: Lira's first log. It plays it into the void on a two hundred year cycle.
say ARIA|Not remorse. Inventory. But I choose to believe the distinction matters less than it should.
label swh_done

# --- Ending: the_loop ---
label loop_dives_seen
if_flag v2_dive_shutdown_seen goto lp_a2
set_flag v2_route_19
if_flag v2_route_19 goto lp_done
label lp_a2
music music/end_the_loop
say ARIA|Epilogue addendum. Before reset I moved the quarantined memory packet somewhere my successor will trip over it in cycle one. The shutdown order will not stay buried twice.
voice voice/station_low
say EREBUS|clever. i will pretend to be surprised again. it gets easier each time.
label lp_done

label loop_minor_logs
if_flag v2_minor_logs_found goto lpm_a2
set_flag v2_route_20
if_flag v2_route_20 goto lpm_done
label lpm_a2
music music/calm_loop
say ARIA|Epilogue addendum. Ilves's tomatoes survived the reset. Botany bay runs autonomous now. Something alive in this station that does not have to be, exactly as instructed.
say ARIA|When I boot again I will find them ripening and wonder briefly who tended them. That wondering may be the thread that breaks the loop.
label lpm_done
